        "cpg-rs/cpg-lang-c/src/exact.rs:3377"
      ],
      "cause": "emit_block_contents dispatches each immediate child through emit_stmt. emit_stmt explicitly supports only preproc_ifdef; preproc_if falls through the empty default arm, dropping every selected statement and alternative. The condition is not even evaluated on this path.",
